  <!-- THE CHALLENGE -->
  <section class="sec challenge" id="challenge">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow cv">The challenge</p>
      <h2 class="cv d1" style="max-width:18ch">When everything speaks, what do you listen to? </h2>
      <p class="lead cv d2" style="max-width:58ch">The challenge isn't hearing everything.
        It's knowing what matters. </p>
      <p class="cv d2" style="max-width:58ch">SAGA helps turn that complexity into intelligence you can understand
        and act on.</p>

      <div class="challenge-grid">
        <div class="challenge-card cv">
          <span class="ico">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
              <path d="M3 12v0M6.5 9v6M10 6v12M13.5 8v8M17 5v14M20.5 10v4" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="n">01</span>
          <h3>Too Much Noise</h3>
          <i class="rule"></i>
          <p>Millions of conversations make it hard to spot what really matters.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="challenge-card cv d1">
          <span class="ico">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
              <circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5" />
              <path d="M20 20l-4.8-4.8" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="n">02</span>
          <h3>Hidden Signals</h3>
          <i class="rule"></i>
          <p>Important warnings can be buried inside everyday conversations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="challenge-card cv d2">
          <span class="ico">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M3 16l6-6 4 4 8-9" />
              <path d="M15 5h6v6" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="n">03</span>
          <h3>Fast-Moving Stories</h3>
          <i class="rule"></i>
          <p>Stories, campaigns and issues can spread quickly and change fast.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="challenge-card cv d3">
          <span class="ico">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
              <circle cx="5" cy="8" r="1.8" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1.8" />
              <circle cx="19" cy="9" r="1.8" />
              <circle cx="14" cy="6" r="1.8" />
              <path d="M6.5 9l4.5 6.3M13.5 7l4 1.4" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="n">04</span>
          <h3>Missing Context</h3>
          <i class="rule"></i>
          <p>A single signal rarely tells the full story. Context makes it meaningful.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 NOISE -->
  <div class="pin" data-scene="noise">
    <div class="sticky">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="copy">
          <span class="stagechip"><b>00</b> The problem</span>
          <h2>You can see the activity. You can't see what matters.</h2>
          <p>An officer screenshotting posts into a WhatsApp group. A field worker reporting mood by phone. A comms head
            who learns about the crisis when a journalist calls.</p>
          <p>The signal is already public. It is just buried under everything else that is also public.</p>
          <div class="metricrow">
            <div><span class="k">Posts / day</span><span class="v">2.8M</span></div>
            <div><span class="k">Actually matter</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--orange)">312</span></div>
            <div><span class="k">Found in time</span><span class="v">—</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 03 OBSERVE -->
  <div class="pin" data-scene="observe">
    <div class="sticky">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="copy">
          <span class="stagechip"><b>01</b> Observe</span>
          <h2>See what is happening.</h2>
          <p>Conversations, content, news, events and feeds — pulled continuously from every source that matters to you,
            in the languages your region actually speaks, and organised into one readable stream.</p>
          <div class="metricrow">
            <div><span class="k">Sources</span><span class="v">Social · News · RSS</span></div>
            <div><span class="k">Languages</span><span class="v">EN · TE · HI · TA</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 04 UNDERSTAND -->
  <section class="sec understand" id="understand">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow rv">02 — Understand</p>
      <h2 class="rv d1" style="max-width:16ch">Know what the signals mean.</h2>
      <p class="lead rv d2" style="max-width:56ch">SAGA uses AI-driven analysis to turn digital activity into
        meaningful intelligence.</p>
      <p class="rv d2" style="max-width:56ch">It helps reveal sentiment, intent, narratives, threats, trends, entities
        and relationships.</p>

      <div class="intel-grid">
        <div class="intel-card rv">
          <span class="intel-ico">☺</span>
          <h3>Sentiment</h3>
          <p>Understand how people are responding.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intel-card rv d1">
          <span class="intel-ico">◎</span>
          <h3>Intent</h3>
          <p>Understand what conversations may be trying to achieve.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intel-card rv d2">
          <span class="intel-ico">◈</span>
          <h3>Narratives</h3>
          <p>See how stories and perceptions develop.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intel-card rv">
          <span class="intel-ico">⚠</span>
          <h3>Threats</h3>
          <p>Identify signals that may require attention.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intel-card rv d1">
          <span class="intel-ico">📈</span>
          <h3>Trends</h3>
          <p>Recognize patterns as they change.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intel-card rv d2">
          <span class="intel-ico">⌘</span>
          <h3>Relationships</h3>
          <p>Connect people, entities, accounts, locations and activity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="scenario rv d3" style="max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;text-align:left">
        <p>Once you understand what matters, you can decide what to do next.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 05 ACT -->
  <div class="pin" data-scene="act">
    <div class="sticky">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="copy">
          <span class="stagechip"><b>03</b> Act</span>
          <h2>Move from insight to action.</h2>
          <p>An alert becomes a case. A case gets an owner. A grievance routes to the department that can resolve it. A
            report goes upward with the evidence attached — and every step is logged.</p>
          <div class="metricrow">
            <div><span class="k">Alert</span><span class="v">→</span></div>
            <div><span class="k">Case</span><span class="v">→</span></div>
            <div><span class="k">Assigned</span><span class="v">→</span></div>
            <div><span class="k">Resolved</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--ok)">✓</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 06 FOUR WORLDS -->
  <section class="sec" id="worlds" data-scene="worlds">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow rv">Four worlds</p>
      <h2 class="rv d1" style="max-width:16ch">One intelligence foundation. Four specialised worlds.</h2>
      <div class="tabrail rv d2" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a SAGA product" id="rail">
        <span class="ind" id="ind"></span>
