      body: 'Not another listening dashboard. Viral-risk prediction, location-aware crisis detection and source attribution — the three things that tell you whether to act now or watch.',
      chips: ['Viral risk prediction', 'Crisis detection', 'Source attribution', 'Share of voice', 'Sentiment recovery'],
      scenario: 'A single complaint post is projected to cross 100k views within six hours. SAGA raises it before it trends, identifies the originating account and the three amplifiers, and tracks sentiment recovery once the response goes out.',
      app: {
